STEVE BANNON: Why is Markwayne Mullin not aggressively going into places like Springfield, putting people whose TPS has expired on buses, getting them on planes, and sending them out?

NEIL W. McCABE: He could do it, and he’s not doing it. People are getting ankle monitors and being told, “Go home. We’ll get back to you.”

